 "caption": "The record is the header: its picture, its name, and under the name its kind, its code and its owner. Each part of the setup is a container, with its title and its actions above its outline. At a desktop the large part is the main column and the short part stands beside it. On a tablet and a phone all of it is one column. Each brand of the social sign-in is a mark as tall as a control, with its name: it is what a person looks for and what they press to set it up. A filled mark is a brand that is set up, and an empty one is not yet.",
